# Elixir conventions

- Supervise long-lived processes. Use `DynamicSupervisor` + `Registry` for sessions.
- Keep GenServer callbacks thin; put rules in pure modules.
- Tagged tuples at boundaries. UTC microsecond timestamps. UUID primary keys.
- Cast external data with changesets. Pin query values with `^`.
- No DB queries in disconnected LiveView `mount/3` — use `assign_async`.
- Streams for large activity lists. Subscribe to PubSub only when `connected?/1`.
- Authorize every `handle_event`. Never `raw/1` untrusted agent or repo content.
- Spawn provider processes with argv lists, never interpolated shell strings.
- After changes: `mix compile --warnings-as-errors` and `mix format --check-formatted`.
